BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (idempotency or state, so competing workers serialize their check-and-write sequence. Unique request keys) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (prevent repeated commands, natural business keys block duplicate cases, and unique bank references) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (block the same receipt under a different request key. A reused key with changed content raises an error) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (instead of silently accepting altered instructions. The thirty-second lock timeout can reject a busy request;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (retry the identical durable key after rollback. This removes check-then-insert races within the supported) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (local-database workflow, not every possible infrastructure failure. No module initiates a bank transfer or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (promises exactly-once behavior from an external payment service. Settlement records only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (already-observed bank movements.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (The verification and escrow state machine is deliberately noncustodial: RECEIVED moves to VERIFIED,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (then HELD, EARNED, and SETTLED. HELD means the fee entitlement remains on a contractual release) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (checklist; it does not mean this operator holds employer claims money in escrow. Verification requires) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (document references for licensing, disclosures, and source reconciliation. Earning requires) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (completed-service, authorized-fee, and release evidence reviewed by the accountable person. The program) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm (checks references and ordering, not the truth of the underlying documents. At EARNED, one balanced) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (posting debits receivables and credits retained operator revenue. At SETTLED, a separately evidenced) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (bank receipt debits cash and credits receivables. Fee candidates and refund estimates never enter revenue) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.00 Tm (merely because intake succeeded. Reject unsupported cases before earning. This compact implementation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 84.77 Tm (accepts one exact receipt per earned case and rejects partial payments, overpayments, reversals, mixed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 69.55 Tm (remittances, and changed terms. Route those exceptions to a controlled accounting process rather than) Tj ET
